CLASS::Md2miscTestMethods
SUMMARY::The methods sections, with argument tables and discussions
CATEGORIES::Tests

DESCRIPTION::

A page with methods, argument tables and return values.

CLASSMETHODS::

Two methods.

METHOD::ar, kr

Plays grains from a buffer.

ARGUMENT::bufnum
A mono buffer. strong::Silence:: without one.

ARGUMENT::grainDur
The length of a grain. See link::Classes/SinOsc::.
Range: seconds

ARGUMENT::mode
The mode: code::a | b:: in code, and 1 | 2 in text.
Range: code::0:: | code::1::

ARGUMENT::pan
> 0 is right, < 0 is left.
Range: −1 to 1

returns::an array of two channels.

METHOD::new

Makes an instance.

returns::a new instance.

discussion::

The instance plays nothing until code::play:: is called.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD::play, stop

Starts or stops the grains.

ARGUMENT::fadeTime
The time of the fade, in seconds.

returns::this.

discussion::

A fade time of 0 starts at once.

code::
Md2miscTestMethods.new.play(0.1);
::

EXAMPLES::

code::
Md2miscTestMethods.ar(0, grainDur: 0.1);
::
